*======================================================================
* fl.a99 - a module for tests/test_kernel.py (group float): only the
* floating-point include, so that the test can call FPCALL.
*======================================================================
       COPY "kernel.equ"
       COPY "macros.a99"

       AORG >C000
       DATA INIT,TICK,INIT,0
INIT   RT
TICK   RT

       COPY "float.a99"
